                        Partial Revision HistoryApr 16, 1990 - Bill Davidsen (davidsen@crdos1.crd.ge.com)  I got this source mailed to me and found that it didn't work on allthe machines I use here. I modified it so it runs on Xenix, Sun3, Sun4,and Ultrix. Since there's a perfectly good DOS version I haven't eventried it there.  Note: I compiled with the native vendor compiler in all cases,avoiding fancy vectorizing, concurrent, or copylefted compilers.  Changed the option for output to sysout to be p, to match zoo and arc,so I don't keep typing the wrong thing.